<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you ready,</font>

33
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can?</font>

34
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm ready.</font>

35
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Mao.</font>

36
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:54,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

37
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're pretty serious about your studies.</font>

38
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a Fifth Level Worker,</font>

39
00:01:58,790 --> 00:02:00,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get my job done,</font>

40
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I must first... - As a Fifth Level Worker,</font>

41
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disinfection and preservation come first.</font>

42
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most important thing</font>

43
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is health protection.</font>

44
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be</font>

45
00:02:07,990 --> 00:02:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">carried out independently.</font>

46
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Mao,</font>

47
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not doubting you,</font>

48
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but</font>

49
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we studied</font>

50
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">health protection together.</font>

51
00:02:15,250 --> 00:02:16,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I learned all this.</font>

52
00:02:16,070 --> 00:02:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

53
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you teach me something useful?</font>

54
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that so?</font>

55
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put on the sterile gloves on your own then.</font>

56
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:22,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's so difficult about that?</font>

57
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:24,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's wrong.</font>

58
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't even removed the packaging,</font>

59
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I've made a mistake?</font>

60
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you were in the make-up area,</font>

61
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:31,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were the ones</font>

62
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who chose your gloves</font>

63
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before handing them to you.</font>

64
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you put the glove on your own,</font>

65
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've made a very serious mistake.</font>

66
00:02:38,910 --> 00:02:40,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't choose the right size.</font>

67
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:43,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is</font>

68
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">size 6.5.</font>

69
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for a woman.</font>

70
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How big is your hand?</font>

71
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know my feet are size 39.</font>

72
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I know what size my hand is?</font>

73
00:02:53,070 --> 00:02:53,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never measured it.</font>

74
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there even a size number?</font>

75
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me your hand.</font>

76
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Size 7.5.</font>

77
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

78
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll wear size 7.5 gloves.</font>

79
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:09,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here you go.</font>

80
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It won't make a difference.</font>

81
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the matter?</font>

82
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your gloves are too big,</font>

83
00:03:13,070 --> 00:03:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the cadaveric fluid</font>

84
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might flow</font>

85
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:16,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into your gloves when you work on a body.</font>

86
00:03:17,180 --> 00:03:18,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't mind...</font>

87
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do mind.</font>

88
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Size 7.5, right?</font>

89
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

90
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't open it.</font>

91
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take note of what I do.</font>

92
00:03:22,790 --> 00:03:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before you open it,</font>

93
00:03:23,950 --> 00:03:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to check</font>

94
00:03:25,790 --> 00:03:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if it is expired or not.</font>

95
00:03:28,070 --> 00:03:28,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next,</font>

96
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">check</font>

97
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if the outer packaging is fully sealed</font>

98
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before opening it.</font>

99
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:37,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold the folded parts</font>

100
00:03:37,350 --> 00:03:38,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and put your thumb in first.</font>

101
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The outer parts of the sterile glove</font>

102
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mustn't come into contact with your skin.</font>

103
00:03:42,950 --> 00:03:44,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, after putting the gloves on,</font>

104
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll give it a squeeze.</font>

105
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both of them have done this action well</font>

106
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">independently.</font>

107
00:03:49,350 --> 00:03:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's this?</font>

108
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this okay?</font>

109
00:03:51,510 --> 00:03:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do this.</font>

110
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do this.</font>

111
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Mao.</font>

112
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suddenly feel like dating you.</font>

113
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

114
00:04:08,190 --> 00:04:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What next?</font>

115
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

116
00:04:48,790 --> 00:04:49,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. What are we waiting for?</font>

117
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming!</font>

118
00:04:53,910 --> 00:04:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there another assistant teacher,</font>

119
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:55,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan?</font>

120
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">205 yuan.</font>

121
00:04:57,470 --> 00:04:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a moment.</font>

122
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crawfish?</font>

123
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

124
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">205 yuan.</font>

125
00:05:03,470 --> 00:05:04,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not cheap.</font>

126
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">205 yuan.</font>

127
00:05:11,430 --> 00:05:11,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

128
00:05:18,990 --> 00:05:19,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">205 yuan, right?</font>

129
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">255 yuan.</font>

130
00:05:21,550 --> 00:05:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a 50 yuan delivery fee.</font>

131
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did you deliver this from?</font>

132
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From across the road.</font>

133
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it Axing?</font>

134
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Axing.</font>

135
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It only took you five minutes to walk here,</font>

136
00:05:29,110 --> 00:05:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're charging me 50 yuan?</font>

137
00:05:29,990 --> 00:05:31,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think this place is normal?</font>

138
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I walked over,</font>

139
00:05:32,110 --> 00:05:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had chills.</font>

140
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm adding 50 yuan for emotional distress.</font>

141
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:36,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, buddy.</font>

142
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I walk you back</font>

143
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and only pay you 25 yuan instead?</font>

144
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, can't do.</font>

145
00:05:40,110 --> 00:05:41,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I charge 50 yuan all the time.</font>

146
00:05:41,350 --> 00:05:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one charges as you do.</font>

147
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just charging randomly.</font>

148
00:05:43,550 --> 00:05:44,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">50 yuan?</font>

149
00:05:45,350 --> 00:05:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The three of you.</font>

150
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:46,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop eating.</font>

151
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">50 yuan.</font>

152
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pay him if you want.</font>

153
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not paying.</font>

154
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both of you.</font>

155
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's end</font>

156
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the lesson here today.</font>

157
00:05:54,490 --> 00:05:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

158
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teachers.</font>

159
00:05:56,790 --> 00:05:57,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. This is my tuition fee.</font>

160
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">255 yuan.</font>

161
00:05:59,200 --> 00:05:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Investment for knowledge.</font>

162
00:05:59,990 --> 00:06:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">255 yuan.</font>

163
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've transferred it.</font>

164
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wondering why we were learning how to wear gloves.</font>

165
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The first lesson.</font>

166
00:06:09,670 --> 00:06:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was what all of you were preparing for, right?</font>

167
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can,</font>

168
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mind your words.</font>

169
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are props for learning.</font>

170
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

171
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Song.</font>

172
00:06:16,790 --> 00:06:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Chen.</font>

173
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:18,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop eating the props.</font>

174
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teach me.</font>

175
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even Mr. Mao taught me something.</font>

176
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are right.</font>

177
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Song and Ms. Chen</font>

178
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are excellent teachers.</font>

179
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:29,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to ask them what they feel like eating.</font>

180
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you going to ask me what I want to learn?</font>

181
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,450
