261
00:08:30,140 --> 00:08:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Four-word Motto, Must]</font>

262
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:31,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink.</font>

263
00:08:32,180 --> 00:08:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink.</font>

