<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

281
00:09:34,690 --> 00:09:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I quit.</font>

282
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I quit.</font>

