329
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

330
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

331
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured.</font>

332
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've handled situations like this before.</font>

333
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

334
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

335
