339
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am sorry for your loss.</font>

340
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

341
00:14:32,710 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

