360
00:16:31,190 --> 00:16:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wearing this,</font>

361
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:33,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we might scare someone else again.</font>

362
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

363
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The last time we took a taxi in this,</font>

364
00:16:39,550 --> 00:16:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the driver played the sutras all the way.</font>

365
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It felt like he was trying to send us to Heaven.</font>

366
00:16:49,310 --> 00:16:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

367
00:16:51,950 --> 00:16:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on with him?</font>

368
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:53,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

369
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him take it in.</font>

370
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:58,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today is probably</font>

371
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the day his newbie-protection period</font>

372
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ends.</font>

373
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is today's exam hard?</font>

374
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all. I learned it a long time ago.</font>

375
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang.</font>

376
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:33,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did your newbie-protection period</font>

377
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come to an end?</font>

378
00:18:38,150 --> 00:18:39,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My first time assisting</font>

379
00:18:39,870 --> 00:18:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in handling the body of a murder victim.</font>

380
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had nightmares for so long.</font>

381
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kept having a dream about failing to sew the deceased's fingers on.</font>

382
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because of that,</font>

383
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also spoke less</font>

384
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for over a week.</font>

385
00:18:54,310 --> 00:18:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kept wondering</font>

386
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how someone could do something so evil.</font>

387
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

388
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you?</font>

389
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you remember there was once</font>

390
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when a family member</font>

391
00:19:10,390 --> 00:19:12,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">couldn't believe her husband</font>

392
00:19:12,310 --> 00:19:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">died suddenly out of illness?</font>

393
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop pulling!</font>

394
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop pulling!</font>

395
00:19:16,870 --> 00:19:17,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't pull him away!</font>

396
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is still alive!</font>

397
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Touch him if you don't believe me.</font>

398
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is still warm.</font>

399
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't pull him away!</font>

400
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you!</font>

401
00:19:23,070 --> 00:19:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't pull him away!</font>

402
00:19:24,590 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very cold inside.</font>

403
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't go in!</font>

404
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up!</font>

405
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up!</font>

406
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up!</font>

407
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up now!</font>

408
00:19:33,150 --> 00:19:34,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up and show them!</font>

409
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Family members,</font>

410
00:19:39,110 --> 00:19:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand how you feel.</font>

411
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

412
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should we</font>

413
00:19:43,790 --> 00:19:45,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ask the doctors to come here</font>

414
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and verify it again?</font>

415
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's that?</font>

416
00:19:47,870 --> 00:19:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's not leave your husband</font>

417
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at room temperature for too long.</font>

418
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right?</font>

419
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

420
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

421
00:19:58,310 --> 00:19:59,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up.</font>

422
00:20:16,070 --> 00:20:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry for your loss.</font>

423
00:20:36,760 --> 00:20:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go!</font>

424
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That moment</font>

425
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was when I realized what I was doing.</font>

426
00:21:23,150 --> 00:21:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't we</font>

427
00:21:25,470 --> 00:21:26,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">help Wang Can out?</font>

428
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think</font>

429
00:22:01,140 --> 00:22:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something's wrong with him</font>

430
00:22:02,150 --> 00:22:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mentally?</font>

431
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But what he faced today</font>

432
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wasn't gory.</font>

433
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on with him?</font>

434
00:22:10,550 --> 00:22:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He still thinks too simply</font>

435
00:22:12,110 --> 00:22:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about sending a deceased off.</font>

436
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give him some time to take it all in.</font>

437
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When he comes to terms with it,</font>

438
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will stay at Qingliangshan Funeral Home.</font>

439
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

440
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

441
00:22:57,630 --> 00:22:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Begin.</font>

442
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can feels like</font>

443
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's not leaving,</font>

444
00:23:15,420 --> 00:23:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he's not decided yet.</font>

445
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:18,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's behaving like an NPC.</font>

446
00:23:19,590 --> 00:23:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has the worst situation happened?</font>

447
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he stuck in limbo?</font>

448
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it that fun</font>

449
00:23:41,110 --> 00:23:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">watching someone clean the cart?</font>

450
00:23:56,870 --> 00:23:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

451
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your money tree has been growing well recently.</font>

452
00:24:08,470 --> 00:24:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

453
00:24:09,310 --> 00:24:10,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come here for a while.</font>

454
00:24:15,420 --> 00:24:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Voluntary Body Donation Form, Zhao Mingyuan]</font>

455
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:28,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you looking for me?</font>

456
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will be in charge</font>

457
00:24:32,070 --> 00:24:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of prepping today's deceased.</font>

458
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I do it?</font>

459
00:24:39,550 --> 00:24:40,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get your protective equipment ready.</font>

460
00:24:41,390 --> 00:24:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put on your gloves and face mask.</font>

461
00:24:55,310 --> 00:24:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm ready.</font>

462
00:25:25,630 --> 00:25:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should I do?</font>

463
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, remove the dressing on his neck.</font>

464
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Disinfect and clean</font>

465
00:25:51,110 --> 00:25:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with alcohol.</font>

466
00:26:30,790 --> 00:26:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't we sending him to the cremation team?</font>

467
00:26:31,770 --> 00:26:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mingde Hall]</font>

468
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some deceased do turn back.</font>

469
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased is Zhao Mingyuan.</font>

470
00:27:16,220 --> 00:27:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Red Cross Society of China]</font>

471
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

472
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The body of the donor is well-preserved.</font>

473
00:27:23,870 --> 00:27:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is our duty.</font>

474
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once again, thank you for working with us.</font>

475
00:28:00,070 --> 00:28:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

476
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait.</font>

477
00:28:01,870 --> 00:28:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right. One, two, three.</font>

478
00:28:11,420 --> 00:28:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Red Cross Society of China]</font>

479
00:28:30,870 --> 00:28:32,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regardless of Zhao Mingyuan's job</font>

480
00:28:32,790 --> 00:28:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when he was alive,</font>

481
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he has a new identity now,</font>

482
00:28:37,070 --> 00:28:38,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">silent mentor.</font>

483
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:55,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you overcome</font>

484
00:28:55,870 --> 00:28:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your newbie-protection period?</font>

485
00:28:57,070 --> 00:28:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What period?</font>

486
00:28:58,720 --> 00:28:59,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Newbie-protection period.</font>

487
00:29:00,870 --> 00:29:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does it mean?</font>

488
00:29:06,590 --> 00:29:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For ordinary people,</font>

489
00:29:08,790 --> 00:29:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">death is a scary thing.</font>

490
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for those working in mortuary preparation,</font>

491
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">death happens at any time.</font>

492
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you have the courage</font>

493
00:29:19,390 --> 00:29:21,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to accept death calmly,</font>

494
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that means you've overcome the period.</font>

495
00:29:26,150 --> 00:29:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you talking about</font>

496
00:29:28,110 --> 00:29:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the acceptance</font>

497
00:29:30,150 --> 00:29:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of this job?</font>

498
00:29:32,150 --> 00:29:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're asking me when,</font>

499
00:29:34,180 --> 00:29:35,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was probably the moment</font>

500
00:29:37,070 --> 00:29:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I was in Beijing</font>

501
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and decided</font>

502
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to return to Qingliangshan.</font>

503
00:29:43,870 --> 00:29:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since then,</font>

504
00:29:46,150 --> 00:29:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've probably overcome the newbie-protection period.</font>

505
00:29:49,790 --> 00:29:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always thought</font>

506
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that people are afraid of death</font>

507
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because of the unknown.</font>

508
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They don't know what they will face.</font>

509
00:29:57,280 --> 00:29:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, in our line of work,</font>

510
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we are someone</font>

511
00:30:02,040 --> 00:30:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the person meets</font>

512
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the person faces the unknown.</font>

513
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can let the person</font>

514
00:30:07,700 --> 00:30:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">head to another world</font>

515
00:30:09,790 --> 00:30:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with composure and dignity.</font>

516
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest,</font>

517
00:30:15,520 --> 00:30:16,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we came to this world</font>

518
00:30:17,110 --> 00:30:18,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without dignity.</font>

519
00:30:19,830 --> 00:30:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were born,</font>

520
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our faces were wrinkled.</font>

521
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We couldn't open our eyes,</font>

522
00:30:24,940 --> 00:30:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and were born nude.</font>

523
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if we</font>

524
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pass on to another world</font>

525
00:30:29,150 --> 00:30:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a presentable outfit</font>

526
00:30:31,720 --> 00:30:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a clean look,</font>

527
00:30:34,790 --> 00:30:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we're at that world</font>

528
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and meet Yanluo Wang in person,</font>

529
00:30:37,150 --> 00:30:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can tell him with confidence</font>

530
00:30:38,790 --> 00:30:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we have someone on the other side.</font>

531
00:30:41,790 --> 00:30:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's probably a good thing.</font>

532
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am... Am I right?</font>

533
00:30:58,430 --> 00:30:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

534
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:00,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've already had this resolve a long time ago?</font>

535
00:31:04,630 --> 00:31:05,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly speaking,</font>

536
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since you returned,</font>

537
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never believed you'd stay.</font>

538
00:31:12,150 --> 00:31:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you'd leave at any time,</font>

539
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:14,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just like you did in the past.</font>

540
00:31:18,830 --> 00:31:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seems like we were worried for nothing.</font>

541
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:22,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why...</font>

542
00:31:22,470 --> 00:31:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you tell us sooner?</font>

543
00:31:24,310 --> 00:31:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't ask me sooner.</font>

544
00:31:25,870 --> 00:31:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did anybody ask me?</font>

545
00:31:27,630 --> 00:31:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The few of you</font>

546
00:31:29,150 --> 00:31:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were glancing at me in secret today</font>

547
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because of this?</font>

548
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

549
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured.</font>

550
00:31:35,150 --> 00:31:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that I'm back, I will never leave again.</font>

551
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingliangshan's</font>

552
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:39,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mortuary prep team</font>

553
00:31:39,940 --> 00:31:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has another capable force.</font>

554
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The chosen mortuary prep genius.</font>

555
00:31:43,350 --> 00:31:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

556
00:31:43,870 --> 00:31:44,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fifth Level...</font>

557
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

558
00:31:45,590 --> 00:31:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not a Fifth Level worker yet.</font>

559
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My exam is coming soon.</font>

560
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will you give me more lessons?</font>

561
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have the budget for a private tutor?</font>

562
00:31:52,630 --> 00:31:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't skimp on education.</font>

563
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Chen, what do you want to eat?</font>

564
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You name it.</font>

565
00:31:56,870 --> 00:31:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember I said</font>

566
00:31:58,350 --> 00:32:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted a refrigerator...</font>

567
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even deserve that?</font>

568
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:01,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go study on my own.</font>

569
00:32:33,870 --> 00:32:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so thirsty.</font>

570
00:32:35,550 --> 00:32:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's water over there.</font>

571
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some.</font>

572
00:32:43,180 --> 00:32:44,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place is hard to find.</font>

573
00:32:45,070 --> 00:32:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a retro shop.</font>

574
00:32:46,010 --> 00:32:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

575
00:32:48,590 --> 00:32:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you find this place?</font>

576
00:32:50,350 --> 00:32:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place has been open for a long time.</font>

577
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The leader brings us here often.</font>

578
00:32:53,070 --> 00:32:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The people at the funeral home</font>

579
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also get their haircuts here.</font>

580
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Interesting.</font>

581
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not a festival or holiday.</font>

582
00:32:58,720 --> 00:33:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are all of you getting a haircut?</font>

583
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to take pictures tomorrow.</font>

584
00:33:01,520 --> 00:33:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Registration</font>

585
00:33:02,590 --> 00:33:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Skills Competition</font>

586
00:33:04,150 --> 00:33:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requires the latest ID photo from one year ago at most.</font>

587
00:33:06,720 --> 00:33:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. It's done.</font>

588
00:33:07,540 --> 00:33:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go wash your hair.</font>

589
00:33:08,940 --> 00:33:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show me.</font>

590
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You look the same as you did before the haircut.</font>

591
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You looked like this yesterday.</font>

592
00:33:13,070 --> 00:33:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

593
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's short over here. Look.</font>

594
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can see my eyebrows.</font>

595
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let's get a wash.
- What a waste of money.</font>

596
00:33:19,340 --> 00:33:20,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Skills Competition, huh?</font>

597
00:33:20,840 --> 00:33:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Mister.</font>

598
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a haircut</font>

599
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">later.</font>

600
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

601
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also going to freshen up.</font>

602
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget about it.</font>

603
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are not entering the competition anyway.</font>

604
00:33:27,350 --> 00:33:28,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't we taking pictures tomorrow?</font>

605
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are doing it as a formality.</font>

606
00:33:30,070 --> 00:33:30,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

607
00:33:30,760 --> 00:33:32,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's to have something to remember it by.</font>

608
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that a waste of time?</font>

609
00:33:33,760 --> 00:33:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are many incredible peers joining the competition every year.</font>

610
00:33:36,550 --> 00:33:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Winning the competition</font>

611
00:33:37,920 --> 00:33:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is harder than winning the lottery.</font>

612
00:33:40,310 --> 00:33:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's buy lottery tickets later.</font>

613
00:33:41,760 --> 00:33:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We might win the jackpot.</font>

614
00:33:43,150 --> 00:33:43,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

615
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can split the prize.</font>

616
00:33:50,100 --> 00:33:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

617
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I paid for the lottery ticket alone.</font>

618
00:33:53,280 --> 00:33:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we win 60 million yuan,</font>

619
00:33:54,520 --> 00:33:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how should we split the prize?</font>

620
00:33:55,310 --> 00:33:56,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A mouthful of umami.</font>

621
00:33:56,040 --> 00:33:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can!</font>

622
00:33:57,150 --> 00:33:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the taste of heaven.</font>

623
00:33:58,150 --> 00:33:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

624
00:33:59,150 --> 00:33:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Raw marinated seafood.</font>

625
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

626
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crabs.</font>

627
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crabs? Sure.</font>

628
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shrimp.</font>

629
00:34:03,350 --> 00:34:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shrimp.</font>

630
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want oysters too.</font>

631
00:34:05,110 --> 00:34:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want oysters too.</font>

632
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me more.</font>

633
00:34:06,590 --> 00:34:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just have two.</font>

634
00:34:07,280 --> 00:34:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You seem like a gourmet.</font>

635
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:08,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

636
00:34:09,010 --> 00:34:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just spend 50 yuan.</font>

637
00:34:10,640 --> 00:34:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not enough to pay your tuition fee.</font>

638
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:12,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some shrimp.</font>

639
00:34:12,270 --> 00:34:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. You really know your food.</font>

640
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you, they are really fresh.</font>

641
00:34:14,940 --> 00:34:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Give me more oysters.
- Look. Neither of them is buying.</font>

642
00:34:16,190 --> 00:34:17,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure they aren't fresh.</font>

643
00:34:18,440 --> 00:34:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss.</font>

644
00:34:19,230 --> 00:34:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He says your seafood isn't fresh.</font>

645
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

646
00:34:21,590 --> 00:34:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you tried them?</font>

647
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you?</font>

648
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't...</font>

649
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey!</font>

650
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back!</font>

651
00:34:25,750 --> 00:34:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to leave without paying?</font>

652
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a law-based society.</font>

653
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

654
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">40 yuan.</font>

655
00:34:32,710 --> 00:34:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are reasonable.</font>

656
00:34:34,070 --> 00:34:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

657
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your support.</font>

658
00:34:35,540 --> 00:34:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can!</font>

659
00:34:36,820 --> 00:34:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can!</font>

660
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

661
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss. Look at that guy.</font>

662
00:34:39,550 --> 00:34:40,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guy in yellow.</font>

663
00:34:40,750 --> 00:34:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've transferred the money.</font>

664
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

665
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come again.</font>

666
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:44,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

667
00:34:45,110 --> 00:34:45,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care.</font>

668
00:34:45,590 --> 00:34:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A law-based society.</font>

669
00:34:47,110 --> 00:34:47,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

670
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Handsome.</font>

671
00:34:48,840 --> 00:34:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten yuan over here.</font>

672
00:34:51,510 --> 00:34:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

673
00:34:52,340 --> 00:34:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss. Is mine ready?</font>

674
00:34:53,270 --> 00:34:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

675
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your support.</font>

676
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

677
00:34:57,750 --> 00:34:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time for afternoon tea.</font>

678
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's have some dessert and snacks</font>

679
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:02,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">favored by girls.</font>

680
00:35:04,070 --> 00:35:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smells nice.</font>

681
00:35:04,750 --> 00:35:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just eat.</font>

682
00:35:05,300 --> 00:35:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fu'an Shanxiangyuan Braised Meats]</font>

683
00:35:07,670 --> 00:35:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your afternoon tea is a bit too hardcore.</font>

684
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's also get some drinks.</font>

685
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:11,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This and this.</font>

686
00:35:11,970 --> 00:35:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Get more of this. - This.</font>

687
00:35:13,810 --> 00:35:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Get the pig's ear. - This.</font>

688
00:35:25,370 --> 00:35:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this the afternoon tea fit for a girl in her youth?</font>

689
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's an all-pig feast!</font>

690
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We forgot to order pig's kidney.</font>

691
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll order them later.</font>

692
00:35:35,040 --> 00:35:35,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

693
00:35:35,520 --> 00:35:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't we have some dessert instead?</font>

694
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ordered Cheese Durian Crepe.</font>

695
00:35:39,270 --> 00:35:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not ready yet.</font>

696
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this sweet too?</font>

697
00:35:42,230 --> 00:35:42,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you going to eat?</font>

698
00:35:43,270 --> 00:35:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can eat.</font>

699
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

700
00:35:48,630 --> 00:35:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Eat first. - Go ahead.</font>

701
00:35:57,880 --> 00:35:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a good match.</font>

702
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you discover this place?</font>

703
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has everything.</font>

704
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We get haircuts here frequently.</font>

705
00:36:04,750 --> 00:36:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get my stock</font>

706
00:36:06,270 --> 00:36:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from a beverage wholesaler here.</font>

707
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also get my massage here.</font>

708
00:36:08,750 --> 00:36:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting a massage once is good for three days.</font>

709
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's join the Skills Competition.</font>

710
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm serious.</font>

711
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should join the competition.</font>

712
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The four of us are young.</font>

713
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's time for us to work hard and fight for something.</font>

714
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we just getting by and wasting time here?</font>

715
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's boring.</font>

716
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:27,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Skills Competition</font>

717
00:36:27,040 --> 00:36:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a path that leads to greatness</font>

718
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:29,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Qingliangshan mortuary prep team.</font>

719
00:36:29,550 --> 00:36:31,380
